# Client build-time configuration.
#
# Local dev: leave this UNSET. The Vite dev proxy serves /api on the same
# origin, so the app just works with `npm run dev`.
#
# Production (Vercel): set VITE_API_URL to your deployed backend's API base,
# INCLUDING the trailing /api. Example:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://projectmentor-api.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=
